      "html": "<article class=\"ds-story\"><div class=\"ds-story-title\"><h3>Nos vemos afuera.</h3><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M24 3v8m0 26v8M3 24h8m26 0h8M9 9l6 6m18 18 6 6M9 39l6-6M33 15l6-6\"/></svg></div><p>Un club sin horario. Algodón, rayos de sol y colores que alargan la tarde.</p><div class=\"ds-story-bottom\"><div class=\"ds-palette\" aria-label=\"Paleta de SOLAR CLUB\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-story-link\">Su universo ↗</button></div></article>",
